<p class="text-app-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-sm">
                  High-efficiency three-phase solar inverter designed for commercial applications. Features advanced grid management functions, dual MPPT inputs, and comprehensive remote monitoring capabilities via RS485 and Wi-Fi modules. IP65 rated for outdoor installation.
                </p>
</div>
