</button>
</div>
<form class="space-y-4"><div><label class="block text-xs font-mono text-app-text-secondary mb-1">Costo Actual</label><input class="w-full bg-app-bg border border-app-border rounded px-3 py-2 text-app-text-muted font-mono cursor-not-allowed" disabled="" type="text" value="$ 1,650.00"/></div><div><label class="block text-xs font-mono text-app-accent mb-1">Nuevo Costo</label><div class="relative"><span class="absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-app-text-secondary font-mono">$</span><input class="w-full bg-app-bg border border-app-accent/50 focus:border-app-accent rounded pl-8 pr-3 py-2 text-white font-mono focus:ring-1 focus:ring-app-accent outline-none transition-all shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(6,182,212,0.1)]" placeholder="0.00" step="0.01" type="number"/></div></div><div><label class="block text-xs font-mono text-app-text-secondary mb-1">Motivo</label><select class="w-full bg-app-bg border border-app-border rounded px-3 py-2 text-white text-sm focus:border-app-accent focus:ring-1 focus:ring-app-accent outline-none"><option value="">Seleccionar motivo...</option><option value="supplier">Cambio de proveedor</option><option value="logistics">Incremento logístico</option><option value="tax">Variación impositiva</option><option value="other">Otro</option></select></div><div><label class="block text-xs font-mono text-app-text-secondary mb-1">Observaciones</label><textarea class="w-full bg-app-bg border border-app-border rounded px-3 py-2 text-white text-sm focus:border-app-accent focus:ring-1 focus:ring-app-accent outline-none resize-none" placeholder="Notas técnicas..." rows="3"></textarea></div><div class="bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 rounded p-3 mt-4 flex gap-3"><i class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-500 shrink-0" data-lucide="alert-triangle"></i><p class="text-xs text-amber-500/80 leading-relaxed">Este cambio recalculará el margen actual y quedará registrado en el log de auditoría.</p></div><div class="flex justify-end gap-3 mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-app-border"><button class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-app-text-secondary hover:text-white transition-colors" onclick="document.getElementById('adjust-cost-modal').classList.add('hidden')" type="button">Cancelar</button><button class="px-4 py-2 bg-app-accent text-app-bg font-bold rounded text-sm hover:bg-app-accent-hover transition-colors shadow-glow-accent" type="button">Confirmar Ajuste</button></div></form>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- END: Adjust Cost Modal -->
